{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803060/extras/c6e9e2c41e19883993b1280832f2b578.webp?t=1757349838\" width=112 height=32 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this town, things are not as good as they might seem. People live dull, monotonous lives. They have forgotten themselves and the dreams they once had as children. Every day they go to work, buy groceries, pay bills. And it repeats over and over, day after day. It seems that some evil has settled in this town, draining people of their joy and hope. Do you have the courage to change it all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803060/extras/2e1b02bbb06fe322a61550ca45bf19db.poster.avif?t=1757349838\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803060/extras/2e1b02bbb06fe322a61550ca45bf19db.webm?t=1757349838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803060/extras/2e1b02bbb06fe322a61550ca45bf19db.mp4?t=1757349838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803060/extras/597b108c284881306a09f15f5728d600.webp?t=1757349838\" width=222 height=32 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to the characters, but listen to yourself even more. Much depends on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803060/extras/9d917